{"label_alt_en":["Alabama (case of the)"],"label_alt_fr":["Alabama, cas de l'"],"broader":[{"id":"facet.precedents","type":"theme","pref_fr":"Précédents et projets antérieurs","pref_en":"Precedents & earlier plans","is_facet":true}],"id":"c.alabama-case","issues":[],"pages":[223],"pref_en":"Alabama case","pref_fr":"Affaire de l'Alabama","printed":["t.alabama-cas-de-l"],"related":[{"id":"c.arbitration","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Arbitrage","pref_en":"Arbitration","is_facet":null}],"label_scope_note_en":"The Committee referred to the Alabama case as a precedent in international adjudication.","type":"concept","direct_count":1,"propagated_count":1,"breadcrumb_paths":[[{"id":"facet.precedents","type":"theme","pref_fr":"Précédents et projets antérieurs","pref_en":"Precedents & earlier plans","is_facet":true},{"id":"c.alabama-case","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Affaire de l'Alabama","pref_en":"Alabama case","is_facet":null}]],"narrower":[],"printed_entries":[{"entries":[{"article_ref":null,"label_heading":"Alabama, cas de l'","id":"fr.0008","lang":"fr","qualifier":"cas de l'","raw":"Alabama, cas de l', 213.","refs":[{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":223,"printed":213,"raw":"213","seq":false}],"see":[],"source_pdf":775,"sub":null},{"article_ref":null,"label_heading":"Alabama (case of the)","id":"en.0009","lang":"en","qualifier":"case of the","raw":"Alabama (case of the) 213.","refs":[{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":223,"printed":213,"raw":"213","seq":false}],"see":[],"source_pdf":781,"sub":null}],"id":"t.alabama-cas-de-l","label_en":"Alabama (case of the)","label_fr":"Alabama, cas de l'","n_pages":1,"pages":[223],"parent":null,"printed_en_id":"en.0009","printed_fr_id":"fr.0008","see":[],"type":"heading"}],"groups":[{"meeting":9,"section":"9","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0223.02","meeting":9,"doc":"minutes","pdf":223,"printed":213,"texts":{"fr":"…a possibilité de l'élargissement de la compétence ordinaire des Cours d'arbitrage. Cette nécessité s'est longtemps fait sentir: on peut en effet en retrouver les traces dans l'histoire de l'arbitrage, par exemple dans l'affaire de „l'Alabama\". Les cas qu'il a exposés sont des cas de droit constitutionnel. Il est d'accord avec M. Hagerup pour reconnaître que dans certains cas de ce genre il faut écarter la compétence de la Cour; mais à côté du droit constitutionnel il y a le droit de la vie qu'il ne faut pas méconnaître.","en":"…f formulating a programme. He only wished to suggest some problems. The possibility of widening the ordinary competence of Courts of Arbitration must be considered. This necessity had been felt for a long time; in fact, traces of it could be found in the history of Arbitration, for instance, in the Alabama claims. The cases he had put forward were cases of constitutional law. He agreed with M. Hagerup that in certain cases of this kind the Court could not have competence, but side by side with constitutional law, there were the ordinary laws of life, which must not be overlooked.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0223.02","speaker_id":"lapradelle","certain":true,"name":"Albert de Geouffre de Lapradelle","role":"member"},"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.alabama-case","weight":1.0,"end":242,"label":"Affaire de l'Alabama","lang":"fr","start":221},{"concept":"c.alabama-case","weight":1.0,"end":315,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"en","line":1401,"start":221}]}]}],"histogram":[{"meeting":1,"count":0},{"meeting":2,"count":0},{"meeting":3,"count":0},{"meeting":4,"count":0},{"meeting":5,"count":0},{"meeting":6,"count":0},{"meeting":7,"count":0},{"meeting":8,"count":0},{"meeting":9,"count":1},{"meeting":10,"count":0},{"meeting":11,"count":0},{"meeting":12,"count":0},{"meeting":13,"count":0},{"meeting":14,"count":0},{"meeting":15,"count":0},{"meeting":16,"count":0},{"meeting":17,"count":0},{"meeting":18,"count":0},{"meeting":19,"count":0},{"meeting":20,"count":0},{"meeting":21,"count":0},{"meeting":22,"count":0},{"meeting":23,"count":0},{"meeting":24,"count":0},{"m